      "filename": "Cathays Carriage Works Open Day (16528554752).jpg",
      "title": "File:Cathays Carriage Works Open Day (16528554752).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/Cathays_Carriage_Works_Open_Day_%2816528554752%29.jpg",
